  "description": "The cutting words of Lee Seok-Jun’s first love during his school days left a scar that still follows him into adulthood. His fear of intimacy and emotional distance have turned breakups into a recurring theme in his life. One night, while venting about yet another failed relationship at a bar with friends, Seok-Jun crosses paths with Yae Ji-Hoo—a notorious bar regular with a reputation for living like a gigolo. Enticed by Ji-Hoo’s bold offer of a \"crash course in adult technique,\" Seok-Jun narrowly escapes an awkward situation just in time. But Ji-Hoo’s wounded pride refuses to let the matter rest. When he learns that Seok-Jun works as a swimming instructor, Ji-Hoo begins plotting an elaborate revenge scheme. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
